flowchart TD
    A([Yusuf says something]) --> B{Is BackBrain listening?}
    B -- No --> C[Microphone stays off]
    C --> D[Tap Start listening]
    D --> E[Phone or computer requests microphone permission]
    E --> F{Permission granted?}
    F -- No --> G[Show microphone permission message]
    F -- Yes --> H[Listening begins]
    B -- Yes --> H

    H --> I[Capture speech audio]
    I --> J{Wake word detected?}
    J -- No --> I
    J -- Yes --> K[Capture the command or memory]
    K --> L[Speech recognition converts audio to text]
    L --> M{Was the speech understood?}
    M -- No --> N[Ask Yusuf to repeat]
    N --> K
    M -- Yes --> O[Create a transcript]

    O --> P{What kind of request is it?}
    P -- Reminder --> Q[Create reminder]
    P -- Calendar event --> R[Create scheduled event]
    P -- Person or relationship --> S[Update person record]
    P -- Memory or note --> T[Save memory]
    P -- Question --> U[Search Yusuf's saved context]
    P -- Navigation --> V[Open requested screen]
    P -- Stop listening --> W[Turn listening off]

    Q --> X[Update local state]
    R --> X
    S --> X
    T --> X
    U --> Y{AI access approved?}
    Y -- No --> Z[Answer from local saved context]
    Y -- Yes --> AA[Send only selected context to secure AI service]
    AA --> AB[Receive answer]
    AB --> Z
    V --> AC[Show requested screen]
    W --> AD[Stop microphone and speech processing]

    X --> AE[Automatically enrich the knowledge graph]
    AE --> AF[Refresh timeline, calendar, people, and topic cards]
    AF --> AG[Confirm what BackBrain heard]
    Z --> AG
    AC --> AG
    AG --> AH[Speak response aloud and show it on screen]

    subgraph Current_Offline_Presentation_Build
      OFF1[No live speech understanding is required]
      OFF2[Start listening waits 8 seconds]
      OFF3[Offline scripted response: best friends are Aakash and Rishan]
      OFF1 --> OFF2 --> OFF3
    end

    subgraph Intended_Production_Build
      PROD1[Wake-word engine such as Picovoice]
      PROD2[Speech recognition]
      PROD3[Encrypted client-side memory]
      PROD4[Supabase authentication and encrypted sync]
      PROD5[OpenAI only for explicitly approved context]
      PROD1 --> PROD2 --> PROD3 --> PROD4
      PROD3 --> PROD5
    end
